OL,3,ATop Gear to return after Flintoff
OL,4,Acrash, BBC confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FTop Gear is to return to TV, the BBC
OL,7,Fhas confirmed, four years after the
OL,8,Fshow was "rested" when co-host Andrew
OL,9,FFlintoff was injured in a crash during
OL,10,Ffilming.
OL,12,FThe long-running motoring programme has
OL,13,Fbeen off air since 2022, when the
OL,14,Fformer cricketer suffered serious
OL,15,Ffacial and rib injuries when his
OL,16,Fopen-topped three-wheeled car
OL,17,Foverturned at the show's test track.
OL,19,FHe was one of three presenters at the
OL,20,Ftime along with Paddy McGuinness and
OL,21,FChris Harris.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
